<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view>STRAVA</view><view class="hero-title">{{connection.connected ? '已绑定' : '尚未绑定'}}</view><view>授权和 token 均由云函数安全处理</view></view><state-view wx:if="{{loading}}" type="loading" text="正在读取绑定状态"/><view class="card danger" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{connection.connected}}"><view class="title">{{connection.athleteName}}</view><view class="grid" wx:if="{{connection.snapshot}}"><view class="metric"><view class="big">{{connection.snapshot.totalKm}} km</view><view>近 90 天里程</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="big">{{connection.snapshot.rides90d}}</view><view>骑行次数</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="big">{{connection.snapshot.speedKmh}}</view><view>加权均速 km/h</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="big">{{connection.snapshot.longestKm}} km</view><view>最长骑行</view></view></view><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="sync">同步最近 90 天</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="disconnect">解绑</button></view><view class="card" wx:else><view class="title">绑定前请确认配置</view><view>需部署 strava-callback HTTP 路由，并把该 HTTPS 域名配置为小程序业务域名及 Strava 回调域名；未配置时授权页无法打开，不会伪造成功。</view><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="connect">前往 Strava 授权</button></view></view>
